 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Authentication and roles
+
+Every request sends `Authorization: Bearer <key>` using an entry from `apiKeys`
+in the store (`401 unauthorized` if missing or unknown).
+
+- `viewer`: read-only (`GET` routes, except `GET /audit`).
+- `cook`: `viewer` plus cooking (`POST /recipes/:id/cook`), waste
+  (`POST /batches/:id/waste`), temperatures (`POST /temperatures`), and
+  stock-take counts (`POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`).
+- `manager`: all routes, including `GET /audit`.
+
+Requests outside the key's role fail with `403 forbidden`. Every request that
+changes data writes an audit entry (`id`, `at`, `keyName`, `method`, `path`,
+`status`); `GET /audit` returns them newest first.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
